# Build context hygiene (§9.1/§9.2): the image must never contain the vault,
# credentials, or owner-local files. bun auto-loads .env from cwd — keeping
# .env out of the image is what keeps it out of every container process.
.env
vault/
azure/
questions-for-owner.md
QUESTIONS-FOR-OWNER.md

.git/
.github/
.githooks/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
docs/
architecture/
examples/
*.md
!packages/**/*.md

# Derived / local
**/_index/
.DS_Store
